                        "entry_id": "86d2f1bf-9807-3c02-a844-bb722e928eb3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A German dish of roasted marinated horsemeat or (now more frequently) beef or pork."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "88354cb0-6cd7-494d-afec-195edba217ae",
                                "sense_id": "7835c0d2-df5d-3f52-a5be-00d3fae622a0",
                                "text": "My sauerbraten ($10.95) was a disaster, thin slices of beef drowned in a lake of gravy, and way too sauer, although the accompanying spaetzle were firm and buttery."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f4a5e38-2def-41df-a86b-0ba5662bfda2",
                                "sense_id": "7835c0d2-df5d-3f52-a5be-00d3fae622a0",
                                "text": "The worst thing that would have happened if Germany had won is that I'd be speaking German now and eating sauerbraten instead of hamburger,\" he says. \""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18370f81-34b2-407a-9d6c-411d78696725",
                                "sense_id": "7835c0d2-df5d-3f52-a5be-00d3fae622a0",
                                "text": "But some meat dishes, like the sauerbraten, are drenched in sauces that tend to be a little too heavy and sweet."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "014f2d7e-7aac-414e-b245-d8bd99f57509",
                        "source_entry_id": "86d2f1bf-9807-3c02-a844-bb722e928eb3",
                        "source_sense_id": "7835c0d2-df5d-3f52-a5be-00d3fae622a0",
